UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Over a Decade of Digital Marketing & SEO Wisdom 1. 🏃‍♂️ SEO: A Marathon, Not a Sprint 2. 📈 If Not Indexed on Google, You''re Invisible 3. 🔍 Essential: Google Search Console 4. 📊 Marketing = Results + Data. No Data = Wasted Money 5. 🎯 Track What Matters: Conversions or Clicks, Not Both 6. 💬 Effective Websites: Clarify What, Why, Next Steps 7. 📝 Contact Form on Every Page Boosts Performance 8. 🚫 Click Funnels: Losing Steam 9. 🌐 Every Action Counts in SEO 10. 🤔 Marketing: Address ''Why This?'' Then ''Why You?'' 11. 🧠 Page Concepts Over Keywords, Yet Keywords Define Concepts 12. 🖋 One H1 Tag Per Page Rule 13. 🚦 Visible ''Get Off The Bus'' Moments on Websites 14. 🌡️ Embrace Heat Mapping for Site Insights 15. 🚀 Great Product Needs Awareness 16. 🎁 Your Special Feature Might Not Be the Selling Point 17. ⭐ Urgent: Gather Reviews 18. 🎨 Branding Matters, Eventually 19. 📌 Done Beats Perfect in Marketing Activities 20. 🚫 Blog Not Essential for Google Ranking 21. ⚡ Fast Website = Real Website 22. 🎯 One Conversion > Thousand Clicks 23. 📍 Google Business Profile: Local Business Gold 24. 🔑 Build Keyword Pyramid for SEO Success 25. 🎲 Even Perfect Execution Can Fail 26. 🛒 Sales Skills: Business Lifeline 27. 🚨 Lots of Leads ≠ Good Sales Process 28. 👎 Can''t Market a Bad Product Long 29. 🦸 Customer: The Hero of Your Story 30. 🚩 Branding ≠ Marketing; They Can Intersect 31. 💰 Compete on Price, Win on Price 32. 💸 Quality Marketing Isn''t Cheap 33. 🛠️ Sales: Solution to Many Problems 34. 🛍️ E-commerce Tip: Use Shopify 35. 📊 Not All Great Marketing is Measurable 36. 🕵️‍♂️ Borrow Competitor Ideas, Make Them Unique 37. ⏱️ Timeliness in Marketing is Key 38. 👵 Website Building: Pass the Mom Test 39. 📱 No One Remembers Bad Social Posts, Only the Best 40. 🔝 SEO: Quantity Often Trumps Quality 41. 🔗 Backlinks: Common Trait of Top Webpages 42. 📢 If You Link Social Media, Be Active On It 43. 🎣 Clickbait Titles Work 44. 🤝 Trust-Building in Marketing: Go for Video 45. 🔄 Regular Website Updates > Infrequent Overhauls 46. 🕒 Longer Site Visits = Better SEO 47. 📱 Google''s SEO Checks: Mobile-First 48. 🎥 First 7 Secs Crucial in Video & Email Headlines 49. 🔍 Target Long Tail, Specific Keywords 50. 🗣️ Customer Feedback = Path to Success 51. 🌟 Connect with Favorite Influencers for Promos 52. ✉️ Email Marketing: Alive & Core of Community Focus 53. 🛬 Landing Page Essentials: Headline, Image, Form 54. 🗣️ Write Website Copy Naturally for Voice Search 55. 📈 Weekly Google Business Profile Updates 56. 🤖 AI: Start, Don''t End with It 57. 📢 Consistent Brand Messaging Across Channels 58. 👍 Engage with Competitors on Social Media 59. 🌐 Building Online Community: Future of Marketing 60. 🔄 Only 2% of Customers Refer: Expand Beyond 61. 📚 One Big Content Piece > Many Small Ones 62. 🎯 Tailor Messages for Each Demographic 63. 🌍 SEO Easier in Non-English Languages 64. 🌈 Branding Beyond Logo: Colors, Style, Vibe 65. 📣 Explore Ads Beyond Google & Facebook 66. 💡 Successful Brands: Transparency & Authenticity 67. ✨ Impact Favorite: Let Me Know in Comments! 68. 🤔 Part Two Needed? 👇 Drop Your Thoughts & Questions Below!' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7330678020606381343';
