UPDATE public.stories SET title = 'Here’s Our Strategy for growth on Social media 1. Post twice daily on your relevant platforms.  2. Engage with comments through video replies 3. Once a video hits 100K views, invest in it – ads on Meta, Google, TikTok, Spark Ads. 4. Aim for a click-through rate above 2% – a sign it resonates with your audience. 5. Craft a landing page showcasing the pain point the content talks about for congruence.  6. Once the funnel’s successful (conversion rate above 2%) 7. Repeat  Keep it simple or complex, but the key challenge is consistent twice-daily posting. Master that, and success follows organically.' WHERE slug = 'tiktok-7322542418551672106';
